&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:13.0pt;"&gt;１株当たりの買取価格に１単元の株式数を乗じた合計金額のうち&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:13pt;min-height:13pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:13.0pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:13.0pt;"&gt;100万円以下の金額につき&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:13.0pt;"&gt;1.150％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:13pt;min-height:13pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:13.0pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:13.0pt;"&gt;100万円を超え500万円以下の金額につき&lt;/p&gt;
